    <copyright>Passaro Francesco Paolo</copyright>
    <summary>An AI coding agent in your terminal: cloud models, Ollama, or local models with no server.</summary>
    <description>Kodinn Agent: a terminal AI coding agent (cloud and local models, plan/build modes, git, MCP).

Kodinn Agent reads your project, edits files, runs commands and tests and works through git, with any cloud model (Anthropic, OpenAI, OpenRouter, Gemini, DeepSeek, Mistral, xAI…), Ollama, or a local .gguf model running inside the app on the built-in DesireeIA engine. Plan and build modes, sub-agents, MCP servers, skills, hooks, encrypted settings.

Run `kodinn` in a project folder; the first run guides you through choosing a model.</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/francescopaolopassaro/kodinn-agent/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</releaseNotes>
    <tags>kodinn ai agent cli coding llm terminal ollama</tags>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
